
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Lights Out | Setup</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/style.css">
</head>
<body>
    <main class="setup-card">
        <p class="eyebrow">A LOGIC PUZZLE</p>
        <h1>Lights Out</h1>
        <p class="subtitle">
            Every light starts OFF. Can you figure out the pattern?
        </p>

        <form action="/game" method="POST">
            <div class="field">
                <label for="rows">Number of rows</label>
                <input
                    type="number"
                    id="rows"
                    name="rows"
                    min="1"
                    max="15"
                    value="5"
                    required
                >
            </div>

            <div class="field">
                <label for="cols">Number of columns</label>
                <input
                    type="number"
                    id="cols"
                    name="cols"
                    min="1"
                    max="15"
                    value="5"
                    required
                >
            </div>

            <button class="primary-button" type="submit">
                Create my grid →
            </button>
        </form>

        <p class="footnote">
            Pressing a light toggles itself and its four neighbors.
        </p>
    </main>
</body>
</html>
